        "text_WdajUg": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Sheene, your trust and safety are our top priority. Due to the rising demand for our hair-care products, many unauthorized websites, online sellers, and local shops have started offering <strong>fake or counterfeit Sheene items</strong>. These imitations may look similar, but they <strong>do not contain our certified ingredients</strong>, fail to deliver results, and can even cause damage.</p><p>To protect our customers, we want to make it clear:</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "center",
