          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We guarantee 100% authentic products, with proper quality checks, secure packaging, and verified batch tracking.</p><p>Our goal is to help you easily <strong>identify original Sheena products</strong> and avoid scams. Inside this website, you will find clear guidance on how to spot fake sellers, how to confirm authenticity, and how to ensure you always receive genuine Havelyn quality.</p><p>Choose wisely. Stay safe. Always buy <strong>Sheene</strong> from the <strong>original, authorized source.</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
